                        <div style="padding:0 1.25rem 1rem;color:rgba(11,31,63,.78);display:none;">Yes. Enterprise and custom-scoped engagements are priced based on scope, duration, and resource requirements. We invite you to contact us for a tailored proposal that aligns with your organization's specific needs and objectives.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="mb-3" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #dee2e6;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;">
