                        <div style="padding:0 1.25rem 1rem;color:rgba(11,31,63,.78);display:none;">Most clients begin to see measurable impact within 60 to 90 days of engagement. Our structured methodology is designed to deliver early wins while building toward sustainable, long-term transformation.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #dee2e6;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;">
